  "updated_at": "2026-04-15",
  "bio": "Yago Toloi is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in São José do Rio Preto, Brazil, specializing in illustrative tattoos that masterfully blend old school and neo-traditional styles. Their precise lines and vibrant colors are a testament to their expertise and artistry, making them a sought-after professional at Black House Tattoo Company. Yago's work not only captures the essence of their chosen styles but brings a unique flair to every piece they create.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: São José Do Rio Preto, Sao Paulo, Brazil"
}